{
  "label": "norikospring2",
  "title_zh": "",
  "lines": [
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "label norikospring2:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene sky",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/BGs/sky.png",
      "alt": "sky"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Noriko, hurry the fuck up. We don’t have enough time to look at stupid vegetarian food alternatives when starvation is always a viable option.",
      "spk": "Niki",
      "spkColor": "#FF00C2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Nee-chan, should you really be encouraging your little sister to starve? Your life would be incomplete without me and I ask that you take that back immediately or I will be forced to die.",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Fine, don’t starve. But still, hurry the fuck up. The whole purpose of us going out today was to buy things for Ami. And unless you’re planning on converting her-",
      "spk": "Niki",
      "spkColor": "#FF00C2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ami, want to go vegetarian with me? I can show you all of the best spots in town.",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I...don’t think I should. I’m not sure how Sensei would feel about that when he’s basically subjected to eating the same thing as me every night.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene molerat1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/molerat1.webp",
      "alt": "molerat1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ugh. Ami, as much as I believe you’re making the right choice, you really shouldn’t be basing all of your decisions on how your uncle feels about them.",
      "spk": "Niki",
      "spkColor": "#FF00C2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Uh...are you sure that you’re qualified to be saying that, Nee-chan? Your entire career started out of spite for him.",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene molerat2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/molerat2.webp",
      "alt": "molerat2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yes, Noriko. But my success is due to the fact that I am talented and beautiful and wasn’t bogged down by that asshole’s depressive ramblings during my golden years.",
      "spk": "Niki",
      "spkColor": "#FF00C2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I think we both know how you’d have really preferred to spend those “golden years.” And also, Akira isn’t Ami’s uncle anymore. He’s her dad now.",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene molerat3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/molerat3.webp",
      "alt": "molerat3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh, right. Sorry. That’s gonna take some getting used to for me.",
      "spk": "Niki",
      "spkColor": "#FF00C2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I think it’s gonna take some getting used to for pretty much everyone. It’s fine, though. It doesn’t really matter what other people call him so long as I can call him that.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Has anything changed at all since you’ve started calling him that? Any...talks, maybe?",
      "spk": "Niki",
      "spkColor": "#FF00C2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Also, is he giving you an allowance? Because I don’t want you buying anything for yourself today, but-",
      "spk": "Niki",
      "spkColor": "#FF00C2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene molerat4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/molerat4.webp",
      "alt": "molerat4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don’t get an allowance. I get all of my pocket money from my job at the maid cafe.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The one I did the promo at? They’re still there?",
      "spk": "Niki",
      "spkColor": "#FF00C2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yup! And as of next week, I’ll be ready to return and ready to make money again! You should come visit sometime soon. There’s a girl there who’s obsessed with you.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s that Chika girl I told you about.",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene molerat5",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/molerat5.webp",
      "alt": "molerat5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The one with the little sister who wanted my autograph?",
      "spk": "Niki",
      "spkColor": "#FF00C2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That’s what she said at least, but there’s like a 99%% chance that autograph was just for her.",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene molerat6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/molerat6.webp",
      "alt": "molerat6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don’t care who it was for. I sign autographs all the time. But Ami, there’s no way I can go back to that place. They’ll recognize me immediately, disguise or not.",
      "spk": "Niki",
      "spkColor": "#FF00C2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Come to think of it, it’s really weird that more people don’t recognize you while you’re in disguise. You’ve got a pretty noticeable appearance, Nee-chan.",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Blame Mom and Dad for strengthening the pink hair gene. Ami, where do you want to go next? Victoria’s Secret? UNIQLO? Or maybe Undercover so Noriko can get lost and we can run away together?",
      "spk": "Niki",
      "spkColor": "#FF00C2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I do love that store.",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Anywhere is fine, Niki. I’m happy enough that you decided to take me out. Never in a million years would I have even dreamed of going shopping with you.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh, shut up. You’re family. Let’s go to Victoria’s Secret. I know people there. I can get you free underwear.",
      "spk": "Niki",
      "spkColor": "#FF00C2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene molerat7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/molerat7.webp",
      "alt": "molerat7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What’s wrong with the underwear I have now?",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s so...plain. Here’s your lesson for the day — confidence stems from what you’ve got on beneath your clothes, Ami. If you want to feel good about yourself, you need to-",
      "spk": "Niki",
      "spkColor": "#FF00C2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hey...isn’t that girl over there the one who’s been showing up at our special events lately?",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene molerat8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/molerat8.webp",
      "alt": "molerat8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Nao",
      "spkColor": "#EB7369",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I can’t really see from-",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hey, don’t pay attention to Noriko while I’m teaching you valuable life lessons.",
      "spk": "Niki",
      "spkColor": "#FF00C2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh! S...Sorry! So, what’s wrong with my underwear exactly?",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What’s wrong is that you-",
      "spk": "Niki",
      "spkColor": "#FF00C2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Nee-chan, Ami, you two can go on without me for a little while. I’ll catch up with you when you’re ready to grab lunch or something.",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene black",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/black.png",
      "alt": "black"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Okay, guess we’re not going to Undercover then. Which is fine. They don’t really have anything in my style anyway. Come on, Ami! Let’s go! Time to bond!",
      "spk": "Niki",
      "spkColor": "#FF00C2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Are you sure it’s okay to leave Noriko alone-",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Noriko’s fine. We come here all the time. Bye, little sister! Don’t get into any strange vans! Ami, come.",
      "spk": "Niki",
      "spkColor": "#FF00C2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ah...okay!",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Bye, Noriko!",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene molerat9",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/molerat9.webp",
      "alt": "molerat9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hi there! My name’s Noriko. You’re that girl who’s always walking around with the waitress, right?",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ?...",
      "spk": "Nao",
      "spkColor": "#EB7369",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Are you lost? Do you need me to help you find her?",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene molerat10",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/molerat10.webp",
      "alt": "molerat10"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": !...",
      "spk": "Nao",
      "spkColor": "#EB7369",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So you are lost, huh?",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene molerat11",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/molerat11.webp",
      "alt": "molerat11"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": !...",
      "spk": "Nao",
      "spkColor": "#EB7369",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You went out exploring together and got distracted by a fancy mug at a thrift store?",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene molerat12",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/molerat12.webp",
      "alt": "molerat12"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ?????....",
      "spk": "Nao",
      "spkColor": "#EB7369",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hm?",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene molerat13",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/molerat13.webp",
      "alt": "molerat13"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh. Yeah. I’ve got a knack for figuring out what people are trying to say without actually hearing them. My sister says it’s my “kind heart” or something like that.",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene molerat14",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/molerat14.webp",
      "alt": "molerat14"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I can do it with animals too, you know.",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene molerat15",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/molerat15.webp",
      "alt": "molerat15"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ?!?!?!?!",
      "spk": "Nao",
      "spkColor": "#EB7369",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah? You like animals? What’s your favorite kind?",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": !!!!!!!!!!!!",
      "spk": "Nao",
      "spkColor": "#EB7369",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene molerat16",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/molerat16.webp",
      "alt": "molerat16"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh, interesting! I don’t think I’ve ever heard of that one before.",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene molerat17",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/molerat17.webp",
      "alt": "molerat17"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Come on. I’ll help you look for the waitress lady. We can hold hands so you don’t get distracted and wind up getting lost again, okay?",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ?...",
      "spk": "Nao",
      "spkColor": "#EB7369",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene molerat18",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/molerat18.webp",
      "alt": "molerat18"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ?...",
      "spk": "Nao",
      "spkColor": "#EB7369",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No, I’m not going to abduct you. I’m not one of the “bad people” she warned you about. I’m nice.",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ..............",
      "spk": "Nao",
      "spkColor": "#EB7369",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yes, I...know that’s exactly what a bad person would say. But you can trust me! The whole reason I came over here was because you looked lost and-",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene molerat19",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/molerat19.webp",
      "alt": "molerat19"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": !...",
      "spk": "Nao",
      "spkColor": "#EB7369",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ah! You were just messing with me, weren’t you! The nerve of kids these days!",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene molerat20",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/molerat20.webp",
      "alt": "molerat20"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Now, where do you think we should start looking? Where did you two first get separated?",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene molerat21",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/molerat21.webp",
      "alt": "molerat21"
    },
    {
      "en": "scene molerat22",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/molerat22.webp",
      "alt": "molerat22"
    },
    {
      "en": "scene molerat23",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/molerat23.webp",
      "alt": "molerat23"
    },
    {
      "en": "scene molerat24",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/molerat24.webp",
      "alt": "molerat24"
    },
    {
      "en": "scene molerat25",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/molerat25.webp",
      "alt": "molerat25"
    },
    {
      "en": "scene molerat26",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/molerat26.webp",
      "alt": "molerat26"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Huh?...",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene molerat27",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/molerat27.webp",
      "alt": "molerat27"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Huh?...",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene molerat28",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/molerat28.webp",
      "alt": "molerat28"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": HUH?!?!?!?!",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene molerat29",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/molerat29.webp",
      "alt": "molerat29"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Where the fuck am I?! Why is everything so wet?!",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And why am I holding an egg?!",
      "spk": "Noriko",
      "spkColor": "#FF61A9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene molerat30",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/molerat30.webp",
      "alt": "molerat30"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Noriko Nakayama — please report to the principal’s office.",
      "spk": "Voice Over PA",
      "spkColor": "#e6e6e6",
      "zh": ""
    },
